# Line-ending stability for markdown only, added 2026-10-08 on the user's
# "only if it breaks nothing" instruction after measuring the tree: of the 235
# tracked markdown files under docs/ the working copies read 126 CRLF-only, 91
# LF-only and 18 mixed, so the file on disk is the artefact reviews digest and it
# must never be silently rewritten. `-text` disables every EOL conversion in both
# directions: git stores the bytes a lane actually wrote, and a checkout never
# changes a document that has already been measured.
#
# Deliberately NOT a repo-wide rule. data/*.json, *.html, *.js and every other
# *.json stay `unspecified` and under core.autocrlf, because the live feed writer
# pushes data/*.json and the dashboard artefacts on a 15-minute cadence and nothing
# may renormalise them.
*.md -text
